flowchart TD
    Client[原AgentClient] --> Transport[原子进程Transport与stdio]
    Transport --> Server[原产品组合根与Server]
    Server --> Budget[显式公开预算转换]
    Budget --> Runtime[原Agent Runtime与Context]
    Runtime --> Guard[验证工厂装饰器与原请求Guard]
    Guard --> Ledger[(原70元周期账本)]
    Guard --> Provider[原官方Adapter与北京快照]
    Runtime --> Tools[原读取及Workspace Patch]
    Tools --> Approval[原Policy与Approval]
    Approval --> Workspace[独立夹具Workspace]
    Runtime --> State[(原认证Session与Artifact)]
